@startuml
/' English-edition adaptation: Copyright 2026 kingle.zhuang. See NOTICE for upstream attribution. '/
' False positive resistance fixture. EVERYTHING here is correct and the
' validator should remain silent. Each element reproduces a pattern that already
' produced a false positive in some validator of this package:
'   - "Main Menu": contains "menu", but is a legitimate screen
'   - "Reservation Page": contains "page", but has its own specific name
'   - "Show consent form": begins with a verb, is correct
'   - "Register request": does not contain any design pattern terms
' And the diagram labels the flow as FA-01 while the text calls it FA1:
' The normalization of flow identifiers must make them coincide.
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Requester" as ACT_Solicitante

boundary "Main Menu" as B_Menu
boundary "Reservation Page" as B_PaginaReserva
boundary "Request Certificate" as B_Comprobante

control "Show consent form" as C_MostrarFormulario
control "Verify available capacity" as C_VerificarCupo
control "Register request" as C_RegistrarSolicitud
control "Show message 'No capacity'" as C_MsgSinCupo #LightCoral

entity "Request" as E_Solicitud
entity "Capacity" as E_Cupo

ACT_Solicitante -- B_Menu
B_Menu -- C_MostrarFormulario : open the reservation page
C_MostrarFormulario -- B_PaginaReserva
B_PaginaReserva -- C_VerificarCupo : send request and verify capacity
C_VerificarCupo -- E_Cupo
C_VerificarCupo -- C_RegistrarSolicitud
C_RegistrarSolicitud -- E_Solicitud
C_RegistrarSolicitud -- B_Comprobante
C_VerificarCupo -- C_MsgSinCupo : FA-01 no capacity is available
C_MsgSinCupo -- B_PaginaReserva : FA-01 returns to the Reservation Page
@enduml
